  "name": "Greek Chicken Pasta",
  "subtitle": "Linguine with chicken, artichokes, tomato, and feta",
  "description": "Tender chicken and vegetables are tossed with linguine, lemon, herbs, and feta for a bright Greek-style skillet pasta.",
